---
// FTC-compliant affiliate disclosure box
---

<aside
    class="affiliate-disclosure"
    role="note"
    aria-label="Affiliate Disclosure"
>
  <div class="disclosure-header">
    <svg class="disclosure-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"
         aria-hidden="true">
      <path fill-rule="evenodd"
            d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7-4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zM9 9a1 1 0 000 2v3a1 1 0 001 1h1a1 1 0 100-2v-3a1 1 0 00-1-1H9z"
            clip-rule="evenodd"/>
    </svg>
    <strong>Disclosure</strong>
  </div>
  <p>
    Some links on this page are affiliate links, which means we may earn a
    commission if you make a purchase. This comes at no additional cost to you
    and helps us keep FloatJet running. We only recommend tools we've personally
    tested or genuinely believe will help you work more efficiently.
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .affiliate-disclosure {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(224, 251, 252, 0.15), rgba(128, 206, 215, 0.1));
    border: 1px solid rgba(128, 206, 215, 0.3);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .disclosure-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: #80CED7;
  }

  .disclosure-icon {
    width: 1.25rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
    color: #38A3A5;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .affiliate-disclosure p {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .affiliate-disclosure {
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .affiliate-disclosure p {
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
    }
  }
</style>
